      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳那不卑不亢的姿態……\n很好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
