      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噴火龍、火焰雞、\n炎武王、妖火紅狐、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n水箭龜、巨沼怪、\n大力鱷、甲賀忍蛙、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n妙蛙花、蜥蜴王、\n大竺葵、布里卡隆。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5674706B9F8D3001706B713096DE3001000A708E6B66738B30015996706B7D0572D0300100100001BE01000A6C347BAD9F9C30015DE86CBC602A3001000A5927529B9C77300175328CC05FCD86D9300100100001BE01000A599986D982B1300187258734738B3001000A59277AFA847530015E0391CC53619686300200100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把只有這些寶可夢才能學會的招式，\n傳授給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳使用吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
