      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一是火之試煉！必須以1隻炎武王，\n挑戰3隻水屬性寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
